WEBVTT

00:03:28.996 --> 00:03:31.871
and equipped to respond
and fix the problem.

00:03:33.871 --> 00:03:36.954
My team and our partners
have scaled this technology

00:03:36.996 --> 00:03:42.204
to over 15,000 sites
across Asia and Africa,

00:03:42.246 --> 00:03:44.121
